<title>FRANCE: Two French navy divers missing off Riviera.</title>
<headline>Two French navy divers missing off Riviera.</headline>
<dateline>SAINT-RAPHAEL, France 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two French navy divers went missing during manoeuvres at sea off the French Riviera on Thursday, maritime authorities said.</p>
<p>A helicopter and two patrol boats were scouring the sea between the resorts of Cannes and Saint-Raphael but failed to find them.</p>
</text>
